      "title": {
        "en": "Zapraszać"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Zapraszać* is to invite: *zapraszam, zapraszasz, zaprasza, zapraszamy, zapraszacie, zapraszają*. *Zapraszamy na kolację!* (Come for supper!) uses *na* and the accusative, like *na śniadanie* and *na obiad*."
      },
      "conjugation": {
        "verb": "zapraszać",
        "meaning": {
          "en": "to invite"
        },
        "forms": {
          "ja": "zapraszam",
          "ty": "zapraszasz",
          "on": "zaprasza",
          "my": "zapraszamy",
          "wy": "zapraszacie",
          "oni": "zapraszają"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpk1-l08-c1-t02",
      "before": "kpk1-l08-c1-e06",
      "title": {
        "en": "Pyszne!"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Smaczny* is tasty and *pyszny* delicious (*pyszna* = *bardzo smaczna*). *Sałatka jarzynowa* is a Polish vegetable salad with mayonnaise, made for parties and holidays. A slice of toast is a *tost*, or a *grzanka*."
      }
    }
  ],
